{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026dfb9xhQbHq1794822563.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>胡楓（修哥）與羅蘭是多年摯友，近年更屢傳「黃昏戀」。日前二人作客訪談節目《一周星星》，當被問及這段「緋聞」時，修哥爽快笑答：「係呀！一Pair好耐喇！70幾年喇」，更向主持人區永權霸氣喊話：「你夠膽問我就夠膽答」。</p><p></p><p>原來不少圈中好友都對二人的關係相當好奇，連炎輝亦曾斗膽直接問前輩到底屬真屬假。面對身邊好友的追問，修哥與羅蘭姐索性投入「劇情」陪大家玩，一個笑指酒樓冇位擺酒、一個附和指「教堂都冇位啊」，修哥更補上一句「冇地方洞房花燭」，相當鬼馬。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"c0fb17d4-3377-41bb-952f-1dac5f95bfe4.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20269zOIAMYs591794822563.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p><p>《一周星星》</p></p><p>面對九十多歲高齡依然成為話題焦點，修哥豁達表示：「唔緊要，到咗90幾歲都仲有新聞」，而羅蘭姐亦展現高EQ，笑言：「睇到佢呃到人哋，大家又笑到好開心，咁我自己都笑埋」。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"09f5404b-a9c9-456b-883b-cced3448ccfc.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026aNh4fplpiD1794822562.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p><p>《一周星星》</p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:18:09.110098+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":321,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T09:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T14:28:50.824379+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T11:11:33.911675+00:00","content_hash":"e611df737f53adce2e308fb29754ed41c2a619c9f9b9e54e90e7388e255ab0e0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:18:09.110098+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}